OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy 
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain on Saturday.    
OL,7,FBecoming drier with sunny spells on    
OL,8,FSunday. Turning a little cloudier on   
OL,9,FMonday with a strengthening wind.      
OL,10,FTemperatures recovering to around      
OL,11,Fnormal.                                
